{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640050","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:0:1064005001:0":{"text":"As Chilchuck speaks, the giant clam starts thrashing wildly. You struggle to maintain your grip on the fishing rod, trying not to be dragged into the sea.","source_cn":"齐尔查克的话音还没有落下，巨蚌就已经在疯狂摇动。你拿着...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1064005002:0":{"text":"Seeing this, the others rush over to help, engaging in a fierce tug of war against the damedangler and the giant clam.","source_cn":"其他人见状也涌上前来帮忙，与冥湾美人和尾后的巨蚌展开了...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:2:1064005003:1":{"text":"However, because both sides are pulling against each other, the ship loses control and starts drifting off aimlessly...","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1064005004:1":{"text":"The ship drifts along the surging waves for a long time before finally running aground on an island.","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1064005005:1":{"text":"You get off the ship and settle down to rest on the island.","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064005006:0":{"text":"Hmm, the ship seems fine. We can head out once the tide comes in.","source_cn":"唔，船身好像没有太大损伤，等涨潮了应该就能离开。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9F1202A1F30F8920","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064005007:1":{"text":"Fortunately, we managed to catch the damedangler. We almost let all our previous efforts go to waste.","source_cn":"幸好冥湾美人被控制住了，不然之前的努力就白费了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x6FAA78F02A021673","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064005008:1":{"text":"Though it came with a giant clam attached.","source_cn":"还附带了巨蚌。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFB2EB41E8339136D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064005009:1":{"text":"The damedangler's liver is okay, right?","source_cn":"应该不会影响到冥湾美人的肝脏吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5ADFA5DEC39F71BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064005010:1":{"text":"The organs should be fine. I'll have to handle the fish with caution.","source_cn":"对内脏不会有损伤，只是处理的时候要小心。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x24F139F352826074","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064005011:1":{"text":"...Wait, why do I feel like something's missing?","source_cn":"……等等，总觉得以上对话中好像少了些什么。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE1689921277E838A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064005012:1":{"text":"Are we missing someone?","source_cn":"或者说，少了个人？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x24F351C6B066EE76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064005013:1":{"text":"Ah, where's Laios? He isn't here!","source_cn":"啊！是莱欧斯！莱欧斯不见了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD6D7617CA12850C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1064005013":{"text":"Ah, where's Laios? He isn't here!","source_cn":"啊！是莱欧斯！莱欧斯不见了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD6D7617CA12850C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064005014:1":{"text":"Oh boy, don't tell me he's fallen into the sea!","source_cn":"糟糕，莱欧斯不会掉海里了吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x15E6CCFC2C224D57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064005015:1":{"text":"Laios can swim, right?","source_cn":"莱欧斯会游泳吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA270A1E75223DBB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064005016:1":{"text":"…We're at sea, so just being able to swim isn't enough!","source_cn":"……掉海里也不是会游泳能解决的吧？！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF025E1427C0394E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064005017:1":{"text":"We have to go help Laios quickly!","source_cn":"得赶紧去救莱欧斯！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x382F702AE0ED7ECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1064005017":{"text":"We have to go help Laios quickly!","source_cn":"得赶紧去救莱欧斯！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x382F702AE0ED7ECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064005018:0":{"text":"You all spread out to search the ship and the shore for Laios.","source_cn":"你们分散开来，在船上和附近的浅滩上寻找莱欧斯的踪迹。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5B3068EC85B7C592","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064005019:1":{"text":"Laios!","source_cn":"莱欧斯——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x72D0DEAC6B5D27F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064005020:1":{"text":"Laios, where are you?","source_cn":"莱欧斯，你在哪里？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x95A7A2235A7CFC20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064005021:1":{"text":"There's no sign of him on the shore.","source_cn":"浅滩这里没有他的踪迹。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x0FFB17813C770AB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064005022:1":{"text":"He isn't on the ship either.","source_cn":"船上也没有。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5DCD01FD8EA23708","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064005023:0":{"text":"Suddenly, a barking dog in the distance interrupts your discussion.","source_cn":"突然，远处传来一阵狗叫声，打断了你们的讨论。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFF4E7AB202168BBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064005024:0":{"text":"Is that... a dog?","source_cn":"那是……狗叫声？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1FF7AFF6BD77A3BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064005025:0":{"text":"A dog? On this deserted island?","source_cn":"……这种荒岛怎么会有狗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA7EDDA5AED4F3E7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:41:1064005025":{"text":"A dog? On this deserted island?","source_cn":"……这种荒岛怎么会有狗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA7EDDA5AED4F3E7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064005026:0":{"text":"You follow the barking and find yourselves standing beneath a large tree.","source_cn":"你们循着狗叫声，来到了一棵大树下。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x921A93E88590ED6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064005027:1":{"text":"*Woof*! A huge white bloodhound barks fiercely at you.","source_cn":"而一只庞大的白毛猎犬，正在“汪汪汪汪汪”地朝你们狂吠着。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFC904C41CD459CAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064005028:1":{"text":"It frantically wags its tail before charging toward you, teeth bared.","source_cn":"随后，白毛猎犬疯狂地摇动着尾巴，呲着牙向你们狂奔而来。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA0CBC5A76425B8EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064005029:1":{"text":"A hunting dog?! And it's aggressive?!","source_cn":"猎犬？！还有，也太凶暴了吧？！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBAF440F3BFF7208C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064005030:1":{"text":"Run!","source_cn":"先跑了再说——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7F30F2DBD8A2CE09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064005031:1":{"text":"Watch out! It's going to catch up to us!","source_cn":"小心，它马上追过来了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x8DF6A5B6B55BC137","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064005032:0":{"text":"Ah!!! Take this!","source_cn":"啊啊啊啊啊——看招！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x892D8196E49199A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064005033:1":{"text":"Panic-stricken, Marcille hurls her magic tome toward the bloodhound, striking it squarely on the head.","source_cn":"玛露西尔情急之下，将手中的魔法书扔了过去，正中猎犬的头部——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4C94DD84D0DDCD2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064005034:1":{"text":"The bloodhound collapses with a thud. A bright, melodic laughter ripples through the air before Tasi appears, her enormous butterfly wings fluttering gracefully.","source_cn":"猎犬应声倒地。同时，一阵银铃般的笑声响起，扇着巨大蝴蝶...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064005035:0":{"text":"Hahaha! That was fun!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈！太有趣了！好精彩的场面！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x79F17B94004EA671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:61:1064005035":{"text":"Hahaha! That was fun!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈！太有趣了！好精彩的场面！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x79F17B94004EA671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1064005036:1":{"text":"Could it be that this was the work of this thing?","source_cn":"所以，这一切都是这位……搞的鬼？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBA63BF007329B087","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064005037:0":{"text":"I guess so... Everyone, this is Tasi, the fairy of dreams who loves playing pranks.","source_cn":"应该是……各位，这是塔西，一个喜欢恶作剧的梦守妖精。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x50F2D3FAA8AD3A3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064005038:1":{"text":"I was sure that Laios was here...","source_cn":"我还以为莱欧斯也在呢……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE80EE89C240266F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064005039:0":{"text":"Come on, take a closer look at the hound!","source_cn":"哎呀，你们再仔细看看那个猎犬嘛！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4234D9C905733AE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064005040:0":{"text":"Huh? The dog isn't... Laios is lying on the ground!","source_cn":"咦？狗不见了……等等，莱欧斯倒下了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC7928B3F14D75C01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064005041:0":{"text":"Ugh, my head hurts...","source_cn":"唔……头好痛。<key:dialog64>","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAF4710873F14A541","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:73:1064005042:0":{"text":"Sorry, Laios! I didn't know it was you!","source_cn":"啊，对不起，莱欧斯！我不知道那是你！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB323BBD8D79BF0B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:74:1064005042":{"text":"Sorry, Laios! I didn't know it was you!","source_cn":"啊，对不起，莱欧斯！我不知道那是你！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB323BBD8D79BF0B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1064005043:0":{"text":"Why should I apologize? I merely projected a dream one of you had.","source_cn":"我才不要道歉呢，我只是投射了某个人梦境中的形象而已。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x9B1410B1405F7F2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1064005044:0":{"text":"I didn't lay a finger on him!","source_cn":"我可没直接动手！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x113636EBB78950E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064005045:0":{"text":"...What happened? Wasn't I chasing a Mermaid on a damedangler?","source_cn":"……发生了什么？我不是骑在了冥湾美人身上追人鱼吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4D7E5230317EB347","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1064005046:0":{"text":"Um... That...","source_cn":"那个……呃……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x74294B7DCFB7F329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:81:1064005047:0":{"text":"Why does my head hurt so much? Like I just got smacked by something heavy.","source_cn":"但我的头有点痛，感觉是被什么重物砸中了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x499BF991DBC73442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:82:1064005047":{"text":"Why does my head hurt so much? Like I just got smacked by something heavy.","source_cn":"但我的头有点痛，感觉是被什么重物砸中了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x499BF991DBC73442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:83:1064005048:0":{"text":"I see!","source_cn":"原来如此啊！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xF45319E7E3A902AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:85:1064005049:1":{"text":"Since you're fine, could you let it slide so we can all move on?","source_cn":"人看起来没事，就让这件事这么过去吧……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x27FD4C3656F38844","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1064005050:1":{"text":"Ugh... I still don't feel quite myself...","source_cn":"唔……好像哪里还是不太对劲……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD9DE83677B200A25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:87:1064005051:1":{"text":"Oh, your head still hurts? Want me to heal you with magic? I'm confident in my speed!","source_cn":"头还在痛吗？要不要我用魔法帮你回复下？回复的速度我可是...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:88:1064005052:1":{"text":"Thanks, but no thanks!","source_cn":"不用！完全用不着！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x2D897399D1D2C12A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:89:1064005053:1":{"text":"Ah! I think I'm just... starving! Maybe all that chasing my dream has drained my energy...","source_cn":"啊！这种感觉是——饿了！梦里的追逐战也会消耗体力吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBA9434989DAE8FF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:90:1064005053":{"text":"Ah! I think I'm just... starving! Maybe all that chasing my dream has drained my energy...","source_cn":"啊！这种感觉是——饿了！梦里的追逐战也会消耗体力吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBA9434989DAE8FF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:91:1064005054:1":{"text":"Let's forget about the dream! If you're hungry, let's cook some food here! We even have the ingredients, so come on!","source_cn":"别管做梦了！莱欧斯已经饿了，总之我们现在开始做饭吧？手...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:92:1064005055:1":{"text":"...This shift in topic is way too forced.","source_cn":"……转折也太生硬了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFC19DA89A924BC9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:93:1064005056:0":{"text":"Speaking of food, I'm feeling a bit hungry too.","source_cn":"不过，我也有点饿了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE8DC6D9C507E8927","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:95:1064005057:0":{"text":"What are you guys planning to cook?","source_cn":"所以你们要做什么吃呢？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE7FC9CA4FD853948","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:96:1064005058:0":{"text":"I saw all kinds of monster dishes in your dreams!","source_cn":"我在你们的梦境里看到了各种各样的魔物料理！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE7ECE58F19C9170A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:97:1064005059:0":{"text":"It looked really tasty. I want to eat it too!","source_cn":"我好馋，我想吃，我要吃到！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9F4236EB0B86B442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:99:1064005060:1":{"text":"I don't mind preparing an extra set of cutlery.","source_cn":"老夫倒是不介意多准备一副碗筷。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9E3E647C50C7B158","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:100:1064005061:0":{"text":"But I need to make sure the ingredients are safe to eat, before anything else.","source_cn":"不过首先要确保食材的安全程度。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x88B3E9220CFF1EB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:101:1064005062:1":{"text":"Don't worry, these can all be eaten raw!","source_cn":"放心吧，这些都可以直接生吃！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD3BEB9EADCD466BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:103:1064005063:1":{"text":"Raw? I'll pass. Getting food poisoning is the worst.","source_cn":"……还是不要生吃了吧，食物中毒的感觉太差了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x12B4FED312938372","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:105:1064005064:1":{"text":"Nobody told you it was okay to eat raw parasites, alright? We're having seafood this time.","source_cn":"你那是生吃寄生虫，和生吃海鲜完全不一样吧！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xED7DE0BD46721216","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:107:1064005065:0":{"text":"Let's go with seafood congee then.","source_cn":"那么，这次就做海鲜粥吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4C0FF50BD5F6D4DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:108:1064005066:0":{"text":"I'll take out the damedangler's liver first, then cook the rest.","source_cn":"老夫先把冥湾美人的肝脏取出保存，其余的部分就用在锅里吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xDBFF542501A8CB5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:110:1064005067:0":{"text":"Let me throw some rice into the pot, add water, and bring it to a boil.","source_cn":"先将生米放在锅中加水煮沸。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3E0B9E344A1079B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:112:1064005068:0":{"text":"In the meantime, I can open the clam's shell, cut the flesh into pieces, and put them into the pot.","source_cn":"同时撬开蚌壳，将蚌肉和顶上的肉芽切块，下入锅中。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF104612472E68462","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:114:1064005069:0":{"text":"Now, peel off the damedangler's skin and cut its flesh into slices. After adding the fish slices to the congee, sprinkle some white pepper and fish sauce to season.","source_cn":"冥湾美人去皮切片后放入，最后撒上白胡椒和鱼露调味。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4FC5045CBB9636A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:115:1064005070:1":{"text":"It's done.","source_cn":"完成了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB697A1D80534FE6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:115::2":{"text":"Rustport Seafood Porridge","source_cn":"锈锚海鲜粥","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E240D83740A1BFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:117:1064005071:0":{"text":"Amazing! This is professional skill!","source_cn":"好厉害！专业级的厨艺！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1E1EC45B6CECAFD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:119:1064005072:0":{"text":"How about you guys stay a couple more days on Dream Isle?","source_cn":"你们要不要在藏梦岛多待几天呢？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA18CCEAAD237FE34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:121:1064005073:0":{"text":"I can show you more exotic foods we have here!","source_cn":"我可以带你们去找更多奇特食材！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x554666AF93311E80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:122:1064005073":{"text":"I can show you more exotic foods we have here!","source_cn":"我可以带你们去找更多奇特食材！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x554666AF93311E80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:123:1064005074:0":{"text":"Well, I guess I have no reason to keep you here any longer...","source_cn":"唉……你果然还是一如既往地忙啊。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xB447CCD4CBEFBBE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:124:1064005075:0":{"text":"If that's the case, I won't insist. But at least let me thank you for the meal.","source_cn":"既然不能多留你们，至少让我做出感谢！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x88090034CD3203FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:125:1064005076:0":{"text":"May you have a special dream tonight and even gain some insights for your journey!","source_cn":"我会祝福你们今晚都做个特别的梦，说不定还有一些旅途的启示哦！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x72D33F85A86C67BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:122:0:1":{"text":"They're looking for a party member.","source_cn":"他们急着找回同伴","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF1EA77BFF245CEE2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"They're looking for a party member.","female":"They're looking for a party member.","variant_male_record_index":"59968","variant_female_record_index":"59969","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:122:1:2":{"text":"We need to hurry to Cedartown.","source_cn":"我们得赶去雪松镇","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7968B89B81CEADF3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We need to hurry to Cedartown.","female":"We need to hurry to Cedartown.","variant_male_record_index":"59970","variant_female_record_index":"59971","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:90:0:1":{"text":"... There could be another reason.","source_cn":"……或许不是梦里的追逐战","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDEF898DF2212BD94","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... There could be anothe